1.Write the full form and one-line use of: HTTP, HTTPS, FTP, SMTP.
Ans-
HTTP – HyperText Transfer Protocol: Used to transfer web pages between a browser and server.
HTTPS – HyperText Transfer Protocol Secure: Used to securely transfer data on websites.
FTP – File Transfer Protocol: Used to upload and download files.
SMTP – Simple Mail Transfer Protocol: Used to send emails.

